 '/cognee remember on/off with no additional token toggles automatic checkpoint remembering instead. Other nonempty arguments choose recognized node set user_context/project_docs/agent_actions, or default user_context with the whole remainder. Trim, redact and cap text to rememberMaxChars; empty text warns with usage. Require enabled/client, then send remember without sessionId or signal and without prechecking the remember circuit. Success resets circuit/lastError and notifies.\n\nOn any failure, including timeout or aborted delivery, record errorKind, increment remember circuit, create a record with state=pending and enqueue it. This path does not quarantine ambiguous delivery as uncertain, unlike COG-035. If accepted queueing notify queued; if full notify queue full. A queue filesystem exception can propagate because it occurs inside the catch without another guard. No request observation/session-operation metadata is emitted here. No guarantee of exactly-once remote ingestion exists.',
